            "review_title": "Review at Mon Viet 88",
            "review_text": "digitalroc\nCalgary, Canada2299 contributions\n0\nDecent Pho\nDec 2019\nMy friend who is local to the city arranged a trip to Mon Viet 88 which is in Van Hanh Mall. We ordered the Spring Rolls and Pho Tai Viet Nam soup. The soup was good, probably the best I had while in Vietnam, however still did not compare to my favorite places back home in Calgary.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 1, 2020",
